ADDITIONAL TERMS & DEFENSIVE PATENT GRANT
==========================================

1. PRIOR ART DECLARATION
   This repository serves as public disclosure of all innovations contained herein.
   First publication: June 18, 2026
   Repository: https://github.com/shauryasanyal/LithoMesh
   
   Any patent filed claiming priority to these innovations after this date
   may be invalidated based on prior public disclosure.

2. PERPETUAL PATENT GRANT
   The copyright holder grants all users a perpetual, worldwide, royalty-free,
   irrevocable patent license to use any patents that may be issued for the
   innovations in this repository, including but not limited to:
   
   - Fixed-memory IBLT (Invertible Bloom Lookup Table) reconciliation for CRDT state sync
   - Acoustic/Seismic clock synchronization for underground wireless sensor networks
   - Embedded CRDT engines optimized for constrained offline-first systems
   - Reed-Solomon FEC integration for mesh network reconciliation
   - Synchronous flooding via constructive interference in underground environments
   
   This patent grant applies to all derivatives and adaptations of this work.

3. DEFENSIVE PATENT CLAUSE
   If any third party attempts to file a patent claiming priority to innovations
   disclosed in this repository, the copyright holder may assert this public
   disclosure as prior art to challenge and invalidate such patents.

4. COMMERCIAL RESTRICTION (AGPLv3)
   If you modify this software and run it on a network (including cloud/server),
   you must provide access to the modified source code to all network users
   under the same AGPLv3 license terms. This prevents proprietary lockdown of
   distributed systems built on LithoMesh.

